{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"MollieComponents"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Handling Errors"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Map every outcome the payment sheet can hand back to merchant-facing behavior."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/molliecomponents\/handlingerrors"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every entry point — ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentSheet","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentCardFormView","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", and the ","type":"text"},{"code":"molliePaymentSheet(isPresented:clientToken:theme:endpoints:onResult:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" modifier — resolves to a single ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" with three terminal states:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/completed(_:)"},{"text":" — the payment succeeded; the associated ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePayment"},{"text":" carries the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sessionToken"},{"text":" you reconcile against your backend.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/failed(_:)"},{"text":" — the flow ended in a failure, carrying a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MollieError"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/cancelled","type":"reference"},{"text":" — the cardholder dismissed the flow.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["switch result {","case .completed(let payment):","    \/\/ payment.sessionToken, payment.amount, payment.currency","case .failed(let error):","    \/\/ Inspect error and map to your own localized UI (see the table below)","case .cancelled:","    \/\/ Normal dismissal — not an error","}"]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Cancellation-is-not-an-error","level":3,"text":"Cancellation is not an error"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/cancelled","isActive":true},{"text":" is a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"normal terminal state","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", distinct from "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/failed(_:)","isActive":true},{"text":". It fires when the cardholder dismisses the sheet, taps cancel, or the presenting context is torn down. Do not surface it as an error, log it as a failure, or retry automatically — treat it the way you would a user backing out of any modal. (The underlying ","type":"text"},{"code":"MollieError","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" cancellation cases listed under "},{"identifier":"#Reserved","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" are never delivered to you; cancellation always surfaces here.)"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"errorDescription","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" strings on ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MollieError"},{"text":" are developer- and log-facing copy. They are not localized for cardholders — map each case to your own UI strings using the table below.","type":"text"}]}]},{"text":"Merchant-reachable cases","level":2,"anchor":"Merchant-reachable-cases","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The table below covers every ","type":"text"},{"code":"MollieError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" case the SDK can deliver in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".failed"},{"text":". Case names are shown in code font; the live documentation for each (Option-click in Xcode) lives on the real ","type":"text"},{"code":"MollieError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" symbols in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"MollieCore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" module.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Case","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Meaning \/ Cause"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Recommended action","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".network(URLError)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Transport failure before any HTTP response (offline, DNS, TLS, URL-layer timeout). The SDK auto-retries transient transport failures for idempotent reads (GET\/PUT\/DELETE) only; charging POSTs (tokenisation, checkout-attempt creation) surface on the first failure with an indeterminate outcome.","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Transient. Prompt “check your connection and try again”; inspect "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLError.code"},{"type":"text","text":" for specifics. Re-presenting starts a fresh attempt — for a charging operation, reconcile server-side first rather than blindly re-charging."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".api(.unauthorized)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (401)","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The bearer ","type":"text"},{"code":"clientToken","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is missing, expired, or invalid.","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Merchant fix: your backend mints a fresh session and hands the new token to the SDK. Not retryable with the same token.","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".api(.forbidden)"},{"type":"text","text":" (403)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Authenticated but not permitted — wrong profile, payment method not enabled, or test\/live mode mismatch."}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Configuration fix; refreshing the token won’t help. Verify the profile and mode. Contact support if entitlements look correct."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".api(.notFound)"},{"type":"text","text":" (404)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Resource missing: the session expired or never existed, or the base URL\/path is wrong.","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Confirm the token is current and the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentEndpoints"},{"text":" are correct; otherwise create a new session.","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".api(.validationFailed([Violation]))","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (422)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"RFC 7807 field violations — usually bad card input (often rewrapped as ","type":"text"},{"code":".tokenizationFailed","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Map each ","type":"text"},{"code":"Violation.name","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to a form field and show its ","type":"text"},{"code":"reason","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" inline. Cardholder-retryable.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".api(.conflict(retryAfter:))","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (409)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A competing or duplicate operation on the session.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK auto-retries idempotent ops only, honouring ","type":"text"},{"code":"retryAfter","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" when present; a charging POST surfaces immediately (no auto-retry). On a charging operation, reconcile or create a new session rather than re-charging blindly.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".api(.rateLimited(retryAfter:))","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (429)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The request was throttled.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK auto-retries idempotent ops only, honouring ","type":"text"},{"code":"retryAfter","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (falling back to jittered exponential backoff); a charging POST surfaces immediately. Don’t hard-fail to the cardholder on a 429 from a read — the SDK is already backing off. If it surfaces from a charge, review your call cadence before re-presenting.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".api(.serverError(Int))","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An unexpected HTTP status (the wrapped ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", e.g. 500\/502\/503).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A 5xx is server-classified transient: the SDK auto-retries it with jittered backoff for idempotent ops only. A charging POST is ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"never","type":"text"}]},{"text":" auto-retried on 5xx — the outcome is indeterminate, so it surfaces for server-side reconciliation before any re-charge. An unexpected 4xx is likely an integration issue — contact support with the status code.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".invalidClientToken(reason:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"clientToken","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is not valid base64 or its JSON failed to parse.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Integration error: forward the exact ","type":"text"},{"code":"client_access_token","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" verbatim — no re-encoding or truncation — and confirm it was not already consumed. Not retryable.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".timeout(operation:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The polling budget was exhausted, an attempt got stuck, or no terminal event arrived (","type":"text"},{"code":"operation","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is one of session-polling, checkout-attempt-polling, checkout-attempt-stuck, card-payment). Outcome is ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"indeterminate","type":"text"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reconcile server-side before re-presenting — do not silently re-charge. Surface “we’re confirming your payment”. The polling budget (","type":"text"},{"code":"pollingTimeoutSeconds","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") is configurable.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".sessionFailed(ProblemDetails?)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A backend terminal failure, or the SDK rejected an unsafe 3DS challenge or redirect URL (","type":"text"},{"code":"title: \"invalid_configuration\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"detail: \"Unsafe 3DS challenge URL\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"Unsafe redirect URL\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A genuine decline → read ","type":"text"},{"code":"ProblemDetails.detail","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"code":".title","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and suggest another card. For the “Unsafe … URL” variants → a security\/configuration signal; contact support with the session token (the cardholder cannot fix this).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".tokenizationFailed(reason:underlying:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Card-to-token conversion failed during tokenisation — a validation rewrap, or another error in ","type":"text"},{"code":"underlying","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Usually a mistyped card: show ","type":"text"},{"code":"reason","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and prompt re-entry. If ","type":"text"},{"code":"underlying","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a network or server error, the tokenisation POST is ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}]},{"text":" auto-retried (it is a charging op with no server-honoured dedup) and the outcome may be indeterminate — a re-attempt should follow server-side reconciliation rather than a blind re-charge. (","type":"text"},{"code":"reason","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is safe to display — the SDK never logs PAN or CVC.)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".threeDSFailed(reason:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"3D Secure did not succeed. See the ","type":"text"},{"code":"ThreeDSFailureReason","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" cases below.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Depends on the reason — see the next table."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".invalidConfiguration(field:reason:)","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Misuse or an unsupported host state, split by ","type":"text"},{"code":"field","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". ","type":"text"},{"code":"cardNumber","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"code":"expiry","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"code":"cardholderName","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cvc"},{"type":"text","text":" are "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"cardholder-correctable"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (show ","type":"text"},{"code":"reason","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" inline). ","type":"text"},{"code":"host","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"code":"scene","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sheet"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"submit"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"checkoutAttemptToken"},{"text":" are ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"integration bugs","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (present from a VC in a window, not while another modal is up; require an active foreground scene; no double-submit). "},{"code":"\"validator\/parser disagreement\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is an SDK bug.","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Fix the integration for the host-state fields; show ","type":"text"},{"code":"reason","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" inline for the card-field ones. Report the “validator\/parser disagreement” variant to Mollie.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".unknown(Error)","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Unclassified catch-all — in practice where uncaught ","type":"text"},{"code":"DecodingError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"s land.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Allow one retry. If it persists, capture the wrapped description plus request context and contact support. Engineering should monitor ","type":"text"},{"code":".unknown","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" rates (spikes ≈ contract drift)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"3D-Secure-failures","level":3,"text":"3D Secure failures"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"code":".threeDSFailed(reason:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is delivered, the associated ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ThreeDSFailureReason"},{"text":" narrows the cause:","type":"text"}]},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Reason","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Meaning \/ Cause","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Recommended action"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".challengeFailed"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The bank rejected authentication — wrong OTP, the banking app wasn’t approved, or the cardholder cancelled the challenge.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Cardholder-retryable, or suggest another card.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".sdkError(message:)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A WebView or ACS technical failure ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"navigation_error_<code>"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"Unsafe navigation blocked\""},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"timeout\""},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"3DS error <code>"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"mollie_error_<code>"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Mostly transient → retry. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"Unsafe navigation blocked\""},{"type":"text","text":" is a security signal — contact support. Do not show the raw "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"message"},{"type":"text","text":"; map it to a generic “couldn’t complete authentication”."}]}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Reserved","level":2,"text":"Reserved"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following cases are ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"declared but never currently emitted"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" by the SDK. They exist on the types for forward-compatibility. You do "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" need to write dead ","type":"text"},{"code":"catch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"code":"switch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" arms for them — handling the merchant-reachable cases above plus a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"default"},{"text":" is sufficient:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"MollieError.sessionExpired","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — session expiry surfaces as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".api(.notFound)"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".timeout"},{"text":", not this case.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"MollieError.sessionCancelled","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — cancellation surfaces as ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/cancelled","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"MollieError.userCancelled","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — cancellation surfaces as ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/cancelled","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"MollieError.decoding(DecodingError)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — decode failures currently fall through to ","type":"text"},{"code":".unknown","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"ThreeDSFailureReason.timeout","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — the 3DS timeout path currently uses ","type":"text"},{"code":".sdkError(\"timeout\")","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ThreeDSFailureReason.unknown"},{"text":" — no current code path constructs it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"These are reserved as documentation only — there is no associated API change. A future SDK release may begin emitting some of them; until then, treat them as unreachable."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","type":"aside"},{"text":"Supporting payload types","level":2,"anchor":"Supporting-payload-types","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Three supporting types carry the detail you map into merchant UI:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"ProblemDetails","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":" — the RFC 7807 body on ","type":"text"},{"code":".sessionFailed","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Inspect ","type":"text"},{"code":"type","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"title","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"detail","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"status","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"instance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"code":"extensions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The SDK synthesizes ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"invalid_configuration\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (with the “Unsafe … URL” detail) for the URL-safety rejections, and falls back to ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"unknown\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" when the server body can’t be parsed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Violation","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — one per field error inside ","type":"text"},{"code":".api(.validationFailed)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". ","type":"text"},{"code":"name","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" identifies the offending form field; ","type":"text"},{"code":"reason","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is display-ready copy you can show inline.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".tokenizationFailed.underlying","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — inspect this wrapped error to tell a validation failure (cardholder mistyped) apart from a network or server failure. Tokenisation is a charging POST, so the SDK does not auto-retry it; on a network\/server failure the outcome may be indeterminate, and any re-attempt should follow server-side reconciliation rather than a blind re-charge.","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/HandlingErrors","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents/documentation/MollieComponents":{"type":"topic","ti